{"task_id": "Mbpp/270", "solution": "def sum_even_and_even_index(lst):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even numbers located at even 0-based positions in a list.\n    \"\"\"\n    total = 0\n    for idx, val in enumerate(lst):\n        if idx % 2 == 0 and val % 2 == 0:\n            total += val\n    return total"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "def even_Power_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the first n even natural numbers, each raised to the fifth power.\n    Uses a closed-form formula for efficient computation.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"n must be an int\")\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be non-negative\")\n\n    # Formula derived:\n    # sum_{k=1..n} (2k)^5 = 32 * sum_{k=1..n} k^5\n    # sum_{k=1..n} k^5 = n^2 (n+1)^2 (2n^2 + 2n - 1) / 12\n    # Combined: (8 * n^2 * (n+1)^2 * (2n^2 + 2n - 1)) // 3\n    n_squared = n * n\n    n_plus_1 = n + 1\n    n_plus_1_squared = n_plus_1 * n_plus_1\n    term_inner = 2 * n_squared + 2 * n - 1\n\n    result = (8 * n_squared * n_plus_1_squared * term_inner) // 3\n    return result"}
