{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "def max_length(lists):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the list of maximum length in a list of lists.\n    Returns a tuple (max_length, max_list).\n    \"\"\"\n    if not lists:\n        return 0, []\n\n    if not isinstance(lists, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a list of lists.\")\n\n    # Validate inner elements are lists\n    for i, elem in enumerate(lists):\n        if not isinstance(elem, list):\n            raise TypeError(f\"Element at index {i} is not a list.\")\n\n    max_list = lists[0]\n    max_len = len(max_list)\n\n    for lst in lists[1:]:\n        if len(lst) > max_len:\n            max_list = lst\n            max_len = len(lst)\n\n    return max_len, max_list"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, n, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the largest sum of a contiguous subarray in an array formed by\n    repeating the given array k times.\n\n    Parameters:\n    - arr: list of integers\n    - n: length of arr (kept for signature compatibility; function uses len(arr))\n    - k: number of repetitions (int >= 1)\n\n    Returns:\n    - int: maximum contiguous subarray sum in the repeated array\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(arr, list) or len(arr) == 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"arr must be a non-empty list\")\n    if not isinstance(k, int) or k < 1:\n        raise ValueError(\"k must be an integer >= 1\")\n\n    def _kadane(current_arr):\n        \"\"\"\n        Kadane's algorithm to find maximum subarray sum for non-empty list.\n        \"\"\"\n        max_ending_here = current_arr[0]\n        max_so_far = current_arr[0]\n        for x in current_arr[1:]:\n            max_ending_here = max(x, max_ending_here + x)\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n        return max_so_far\n\n    max1 = _kadane(arr)\n    if k == 1:\n        return max1\n\n    total_sum = sum(arr)\n    arr_double = arr + arr\n    max2 = _kadane(arr_double)\n\n    if total_sum > 0:\n        return max(max2, max2 + (k - 2) * total_sum)\n    else:\n        return max2"}
