{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the average of cubes of the first n natural numbers using a mathematical formula.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Input validation\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"n must be an integer\")\n    if n < 1:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be >= 1\")\n\n    # Sum of first n natural numbers: S = n * (n + 1) / 2\n    # Sum of cubes of first n natural numbers: SumOfCubes = S^2\n    sum_of_natural_numbers = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    sum_of_cubes = sum_of_natural_numbers * sum_of_natural_numbers\n\n    average_of_cubes = sum_of_cubes / n\n    return average_of_cubes"}
