{"task_id": "Mbpp/742", "solution": "def area_tetrahedron(edge_length):\n    import math\n\n    try:\n        a = float(edge_length)\n    except (TypeError, ValueError):\n        raise TypeError(\"edge_length must be a number\")\n\n    if not (a > 0) or not (a == a) or a in (float(\"inf\"), -float(\"inf\")):\n        raise ValueError(\"edge_length must be a positive finite number\")\n\n    return math.sqrt(3.0) * (a ** 2)"}
